  <p id="c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001:m0000" ref="f84_da6_42a_AAAA">孔琇之</persName>，會稽山陰人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001:m0012" ref="f84_da6_42a_AA">季恭</persName>，光祿大夫，父<persName id="c-nanqishu-053-kongxiuzhi-father:p001:m0021" ref="f84_da6_42a_AAA">靈運</persName>，著作郎。</p>
